Competitors
Some of the largest Technology consultancies such as Capgemini, IBM and others have not been mentioned in this business plan due to their large size and operation in a different market segment to Freon Chat despite work with a similar technology. They also do not emphasise their ability to implement Chatbots as their primary driver though they do have the resource to do so.

The following are companies in a similar market segment of similar intent and profile. They largely involve the implementation of generative AI.


