The Product

Currently there is a small chatbot implemented on my portfolio site (www.yassahaali.com) that serves as the inspiration for the project. This Chatbot has had minimal development work applied since the launch but serves as a very simple proof of concept. RE-UPLOAD CHATBOT IN A SEPARATE SITE FOR DEMO PURPOSES

With a higher development standard, the chatbot can displace a significant amount of traditional website usage through workflows ex. shopping baskets and purchasing.

The product in this case is an off-the-shelf chatbot service which is often characterised as SaaS. There are subscription and support models for specific companies needs such as more hands-on support for the more involving clients.

